## 3. Input Files

Input files use the `.knit` extension.

Example:

```text
pattern "Tiny Doom Scarf"

cast_on 10

row 1: k10
row 2: p10
row 3: k2, yo, k6, k2tog

repeat rows 1-3 x2

bind_off
```

Blank lines are allowed.



